      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Seams: Harness shape, team values",
      "items": [
        "/setup writes them once, then only reports on them",
        "config.yaml: fixed keys, the project's values; sdlc_needs names needs, never tools",
        "Tracker contract: fixed roles, this tracker's values and axes"
      ]
    },
